s=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She said she didn't know, but she must have had some inclination. I told her she should have told me earlier so I could have been part of the decision process.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le16ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "37000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, Peter. I wouldn't have done that.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Why not? I'm her boyfriend.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You haven't been seeing each other long enough. You shouldn't try to control independent women. It never works out.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're right. I'm not as independent as Amy. She is this smart, adventurous woman.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: As smart and adventurous as me? Haha.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, and she is as tall as you are too, but she can't dance as well as you can. Haha. Anyway, I know she cares about our relationship as much as I do, I guess I'm scared that she is going to dump me.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le16ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "83000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You are feeling insecure. That is understandable, but don't try to force the issue too much. Let the relationship go where it is going to go. Just be patient.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's good advice.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Did you say anything really terrible that could be construed as a deal breaker?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No. Not really.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good. Then I think you'll be ok. Where is she going to in Africa?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She is going to Lesotho.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh wow! I would love to go there. It is not as beautiful as South Africa, but I hear it's a captivating place.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You want to go to South Africa?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh yeah. It's supposed to be spectacular.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hmmm. That gives me an idea.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le16ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob06re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 3, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}